+      <article class="article" aria-label="文章正文">
+        <p class="intro">每到月底，复制粘贴、核对数据、调整格式……这些熟悉的操作，总会悄悄占掉一个下午。其实，用 <strong>Python + pandas + openpyxl</strong>，就能把这套流程变成可重复执行的脚本。</p>
+        <div class="lead-note"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18h6m-5 3h4M8 14a6 6 0 1 1 8 0c-1 1-1 2-1 3H9c0-1 0-2-1-3Z"/></svg><div><strong>这篇文章适合你，如果你……</strong><br>已经了解 Python 基础，希望少一点手工操作，多一点自动化。</div></div>
+        <details class="setup" id="examples"><summary>开始之前：准备依赖和一份示例数据</summary><p>以下代码用于你自己的 Python 环境；本网页无需依赖。示例 1—4 按顺序执行，第 5 节独立运行。先在终端安装：</p><pre><code>python -m pip install pandas openpyxl</code></pre><p>没有现成文件？先运行这段代码，生成本文使用的「销售明细.xlsx」。这会在脚本当前工作目录写入同名文件。</p><pre><code>import pandas as pd
+
+pd.DataFrame({
+    "订单编号": ["001", "002", "003", "004"],
+    "日期": ["2026-09-01", "2026-09-02", "2026-09-03", "2026-09-04"],
+    "地区": ["华东", " 华南 ", "华东", "华北"],
+    "销售额": ["8,600", "9,200", "12,400", "7,800"],
+}).to_excel("销售明细.xlsx", sheet_name="销售明细", index=False)</code></pre></details>
+
+        <section class="section" id="tip-1"><h2><span class="number">01</span>精准读取，只拿需要的数据</h2><p>不用把整份工作簿搬进来。用 <code>sheet_name</code> 指定工作表、<code>usecols</code> 选择列，再把订单编号读取为文本，保留前导零。</p>
+          <div class="code-block"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-title"><i></i>01_read_excel.py</span><button class="copy" type="button" aria-label="复制精准读取代码">复制代码</button></div><pre><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd
+
+df = pd.<span class="fn">read_excel</span>(
+    <span class="str">"销售明细.xlsx"</span>,
+    sheet_name=<span class="str">"销售明细"</span>,
+    usecols=[<span class="str">"订单编号"</span>, <span class="str">"日期"</span>, <span class="str">"地区"</span>, <span class="str">"销售额"</span>],
+    dtype={<span class="str">"订单编号"</span>: <span class="str">"string"</span>},
+)
+
+<span class="fn">print</span>(df.head())  <span class="comment"># 先检查前 5 行，再开始处理</span></code></pre></div><div class="tip-line"><b>↳ 小提醒</b><span>编号须在源文件中存为文本。若 Excel 仅用格式显示「001」，读取类型无法还原它。</span></div>
+        </section>
+
+        <section class="section" id="tip-2"><h2><span class="number">02</span>统一清洗，让数据先变可靠</h2><p>空格、千位分隔符和无效日期都会干扰统计。先规范字段，再把异常记录单独保存，避免把缺失的金额当作零。</p>
+          <div class="code-block"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-title"><i></i>02_clean_data.py</span><button class="copy" type="button" aria-label="复制数据清洗代码">复制代码</button></div><pre><code><span class="comment"># 接着使用第 1 节读取的 df</span>
+df[<span class="str">"地区"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"地区"</span>].astype(<span class="str">"string"</span>).str.strip()
+df[<span class="str">"地区"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"地区"</span>].replace(<span class="str">""</span>, pd.NA)
+df[<span class="str">"销售额"</span>] = pd.<span class="fn">to_numeric</span>(
+    df[<span class="str">"销售额"</span>].astype(<span class="str">"string"</span>).str.replace(<span class="str">","</span>, <span class="str">""</span>, regex=<span class="kw">False</span>),
+    errors=<span class="str">"coerce"</span>,
+)
+df[<span class="str">"日期"</span>] = pd.<span class="fn">to_datetime</span>(df[<span class="str">"日期"</span>], errors=<span class="str">"coerce"</span>)
+
+invalid = df[[<span class="str">"日期"</span>, <span class="str">"地区"</span>, <span class="str">"销售额"</span>]].isna().any(axis=<span class="num">1</span>)
+rejected = df.loc[invalid].copy()
+clean = df.loc[~invalid].copy()
+<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"有效 {len(clean)} 行，待核对 {len(rejected)} 行"</span>)</code></pre></div><div class="tip-line"><b>↳ 小提醒</b><span>相同的订单编号可能对应多条商品明细；去重前，先确认业务上的唯一键。</span></div>
+        </section>
+
+        <section class="section" id="tip-3"><h2><span class="number">03</span>一张透视表，自动汇总月报</h2><p>将日期转成月份，用 <code>pivot_table()</code> 按地区汇总销售额。一行一个地区、一列一个月份，让明细变成一眼看懂的结果。</p>
+          <div class="code-block"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-title"><i></i>03_build_summary.py</span><button class="copy" type="button" aria-label="复制月报汇总代码">复制代码</button></div><pre><code>clean[<span class="str">"月份"</span>] = clean[<span class="str">"日期"</span>].dt.to_period(<span class="str">"M"</span>).astype(str)
+
+summary = clean.<span class="fn">pivot_table</span>(
+    index=<span class="str">"地区"</span>, columns=<span class="str">"月份"</span>, values=<span class="str">"销售额"</span>,
+    aggfunc=<span class="str">"sum"</span>, fill_value=<span class="num">0</span>,
+    margins=<span class="kw">True</span>, margins_name=<span class="str">"合计"</span>,
+)
+<span class="fn">print</span>(summary)</code></pre></div>
+          <div class="result"><table><caption>运行结果 · 使用上方示例数据，金额单位：元</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">地区</th><th scope="col">2026-09</th><th scope="col">合计</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>华东</td><td>21,000</td><td>21,000</td></tr><tr><td>华北</td><td>7,800</td><td>7,800</td></tr><tr><td>华南</td><td>9,200</td><td>9,200</td></tr><tr><td>合计</td><td>38,000</td><td>38,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="tip-line"><b>↳ 小提醒</b><span>这里的 0 表示该地区在对应月份没有有效记录；异常数据已在上一步分离。</span></div>
+        </section>
+
+        <section class="section" id="tip-4"><h2><span class="number">04</span>一次导出，顺手把格式做好</h2><p>把汇总、明细和异常记录放进同一份工作簿，再用 <code>openpyxl</code> 冻结表头、设置列宽和金额格式。交付出去的报表，也可以清晰好读。</p>
+          <div class="code-block"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-title"><i></i>04_export_report.py</span><button class="copy" type="button" aria-label="复制导出格式代码">复制代码</button></div><pre><code><span class="kw">from</span> openpyxl.styles <span class="kw">import</span> Font, PatternFill
+<span class="kw">from</span> openpyxl.utils <span class="kw">import</span> get_column_letter
+
+<span class="kw">with</span> pd.<span class="fn">ExcelWriter</span>(<span class="str">"销售月报.xlsx"</span>, engine=<span class="str">"openpyxl"</span>) <span class="kw">as</span> writer:
+    summary.to_excel(writer, sheet_name=<span class="str">"月度汇总"</span>)
+    clean.to_excel(writer, sheet_name=<span class="str">"有效明细"</span>, index=<span class="kw">False</span>)
+    rejected.to_excel(writer, sheet_name=<span class="str">"待核对"</span>, index=<span class="kw">False</span>)
+
+    <span class="kw">for</span> ws <span class="kw">in</span> writer.book.worksheets:
+        ws.freeze_panes = <span class="str">"B2"</span>
+        <span class="kw">for</span> cell <span class="kw">in</span> ws[<span class="num">1</span>]:
+            cell.font = Font(bold=<span class="kw">True</span>, color=<span class="str">"FFFFFF"</span>)
+            cell.fill = PatternFill(<span class="str">"solid"</span>, fgColor=<span class="str">"267258"</span>)
+        <span class="kw">for</span> col <span class="kw">in</span> range(<span class="num">1</span>, ws.max_column + <span class="num">1</span>):
+            ws.column_dimensions[get_column_letter(col)].width = <span class="num">18</span>
+
+    ws = writer.sheets[<span class="str">"月度汇总"</span>]
+    <span class="kw">for</span> row <span class="kw">in</span> ws.iter_rows(min_row=<span class="num">2</span>, min_col=<span class="num">2</span>):
+        <span class="kw">for</span> cell <span class="kw">in</span> row:
+            cell.number_format = <span class="str">'#,##0.00'</span></code></pre></div><div class="tip-line"><b>↳ 小提醒</b><span>离开 with 语句时才完成保存。同名输出文件会被覆盖，请使用独立的输出文件名。</span></div>
+        </section>
+
+        <section class="section" id="tip-5"><h2><span class="number">05</span>批量合并，告别逐个打开文件</h2><p>每个部门交来一份相同结构的表格？用 <code>pathlib</code> 找到文件，批量读取后合并，并加上来源文件名，方便回溯每一行数据。</p>
